        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;graph TD\n    %% Color Themes matching your reference slides\n    classDef userStyle fill:#424242,stroke:#212121,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#ffffff,rx:10,ry:10;\n    classDef idsStyle fill:#3f51b5,stroke:#1a237e,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#ffffff,rx:10,ry:10;\n    classDef clientStyle fill:#00695c,stroke:#00241e,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#ffffff,rx:10,ry:10;\n    classDef serverStyle fill:#1565c0,stroke:#0a2540,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#ffffff,rx:10,ry:10;\n    classDef backendStyle fill:#a66300,stroke:#5c3800,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#ffffff,rx:10,ry:10;\n\n    %% Main Vertical Flow Nodes\n    User[&lt;b&gt;END USER&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Logs in via Client] ::: userStyle\n    IDS[&lt;b&gt;IDENTITY SERVER (IDS)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Authenticates &amp; Issues JWT] ::: idsStyle\n    Client[&lt;b&gt;MCP CLIENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Stores Access Token] ::: clientStyle\n\n    %% FastMCP Server Container\n    subgraph FastMCP [&lt;b&gt;FASTMCP SERVER&lt;/b&gt;]\n        Middleware[&lt;b&gt;Passthrough Middleware&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Extracts Bearer Token] ::: clientStyle\n        Routing[&lt;b&gt;Tool Routing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Orchestrates Services] ::: idsStyle\n        Middleware --&gt; Routing\n    end\n    style FastMCP fill:none,stroke:#757575,stroke-dasharray: 5 5,color:#333333;\n\n    Backend[&lt;b&gt;BACKEND RESOURCE APIs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;30 Protected Endpoints] ::: backendStyle\n\n    %% Sequential Connections\n    User --&gt;|1. OAuth Redirect| IDS\n    IDS --&gt;|2. Issue Token| Client\n    Client --&gt;|3. SSE / HTTP Stream| Middleware\n    Routing --&gt;|4. Forward Bearer Token| Backend\n    Backend -.-&gt;|5. Validate JWT Signature| IDS&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="DsGsu1kOLYrhjSPbySET-0">
