        <mxCell id="fa3BVWF3XjR6sWB0fTxS-1" parent="fa3BVWF3XjR6sWB0fTxS-0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;graph TD\n    %% Sequential Block Hierarchy using ( ) for Rounded Rectangles\n    Block1(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;END USER&lt;/b&gt;\&quot;)\n    \n    Block2(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;CLAUDE DESKTOP&lt;br/&gt;(MCP CLIENT)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• User interacts with Claude&lt;br/&gt;• OAuth Login Flow&lt;br/&gt;• Stores Access Token&lt;br/&gt;• Discovers MCP Tools&lt;br/&gt;• Calls MCP Server Tools\&quot;)\n    \n    Block3(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;KEYCLOAK&lt;br/&gt;(IDS / Identity Server)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Realm: LNT&lt;br/&gt;• User Authentication&lt;br/&gt;• User Management&lt;br/&gt;• Roles &amp; Permissions&lt;br/&gt;• JWT Token Generation&lt;br/&gt;• JWKS Endpoint\&quot;)\n    \n    Block4(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;FASTMCP SERVER&lt;br/&gt;(MCP SERVER)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Transport Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• HTTP&lt;br/&gt;• SSE&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tool Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• search_company()&lt;br/&gt;• get_company_metrics()&lt;br/&gt;• get_financial_summary()&lt;br/&gt;• get_portfolio_data()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Service Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• API orchestration&lt;br/&gt;• Response transformation&lt;br/&gt;• Data aggregation&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;API Client Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Reads Bearer Token&lt;br/&gt;• Forwards Token&lt;br/&gt;• Calls Backend APIs&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;NO JWT VALIDATION HERE&lt;/b&gt;\&quot;)\n    \n    Block5(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;INSIGHT BACKEND APIs&lt;br/&gt;(RESOURCE SERVER)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Company APIs&lt;br/&gt;KPI APIs&lt;br/&gt;Revenue APIs&lt;br/&gt;Portfolio APIs&lt;br/&gt;Financial APIs&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;~ 30 Protected APIs&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Validate JWT&lt;br/&gt;• Check Roles&lt;br/&gt;• Authorize User&lt;br/&gt;• Return Business Data\&quot;)\n    \n    Block6(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;KEYCLOAK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Signature Validation&lt;br/&gt;• Issuer Validation&lt;br/&gt;• Audience Validation&lt;br/&gt;• Role Verification\&quot;)\n\n    %% High-End Executive Color Scheme Styles\n    style Block1 fill:#4A5568,stroke:#2D3748,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff\n    style Block2 fill:#0F766E,stroke:#115E59,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff\n    style Block3 fill:#4338CA,stroke:#312E81,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff\n    style Block4 fill:#1D4ED8,stroke:#1E40AF,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff\n    style Block5 fill:#B45309,stroke:#78350F,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff\n    style Block6 fill:#4338CA,stroke:#312E81,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff\n\n    %% Clean, Linear Vertical Flow Connections\n    Block1 --&gt;|Login| Block2\n    Block2 --&gt;|OAuth2 / OIDC| Block3\n    Block3 --&gt;|JWT Access Token| Block4\n    Block4 --&gt;|Authorization: Bearer Token| Block5\n    Block5 --&gt;|Token Validation| Block6\n\n    %% Arrow Link Customization\n    linkStyle default stroke:#475569,stroke-width:2px;&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="YRGqKGVwaDBIuoMSMJ7K-0">
